  "description": "Genesys VTT 0.0.168 QA: adds the Realms of Terrinoth Character Creation catalog foundation with 14 playable archetype/species profiles, 8 careers plus the Runemaster Mage variant, structured characteristics, starting XP, wound/strain formulas, starting skill grants, special-ability metadata, career skills, starting-gear choice groups, and Terrinoth silver-currency metadata. Scout starting gear follows the official errata. Also removes the deprecated Foundry renderChatMessage compatibility hook from Narrative Spend and uses renderChatMessageHTML with native HTMLElement handling for v13+ compatibility. Preserves the 0.0.167 Terrinoth Talent Catalog, Talent Library, Character Creation Data Foundation, Actions, Rule Engine, combat, encounter, and narrative dice work.",
